Web Platform Tests (WPT)
========================

Upstream: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt
License:  BSD-3-Clause (WPT)
Fetched:  2026-10-04

Vendored subsets:
  url/resources/            URL parser conformance and IDNA test data
  acid/                     Acid2 and Acid3 rendering tests (used from Phase 7)
  css/selectors/parsing/    Selectors Level 4 validity tables
  css/*/parsing/            Property value valid/invalid tables (extracted by corpusgen)

Only the files needed for offline conformance runs are vendored. The
normalized corpora consumed by `go test` are produced by `cmd/corpusgen`.
